15     4  4  0
16     4  5  0
17     5  4  0
18     5  5  0
19     6  4  0
20     6  5  0

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Specify essential boundary conditions (support conditions)
First line: Total number of nodes
Following lines: Node ID, ebc_dX, ebc_dY, ebc_dZ, ebc_rX, ebc_rY, ebc_rZ
ebc = 0 --> Free degree-of-freedom
ebc = 1 --> Fixed degree-of-freedom
