-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Provide materials
First line: Total number of materials
Following lines: Material ID, Elasticity [MPa], Poisson Ratio, Thermal exp. coeff. [/oC]
%MATERIAL.ISOTROPIC
1
1     100000  3.000000e-01  1.000000e-05

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Provide cross-sections
First line: Total number of cross-sections
Following lines: Cross-section ID, Area_x [cm2], Area_y [cm2], Area_z [cm2]
                 Inertia_x [cm4], Inertia_y [cm4], Inertia_z [cm4]
                 Height_y [cm], Height_z [cm]
%SECTION.PROPERTY
1
1     100  10000  10000  100000000  100000000  100000000  10  100

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Flag specification for different beam end liberation conditions
1 - Continuous end / Continuous end
2 - Hinged end / Continuous end
3 - Continuous end / Hinged end
4 - Hinged end / Hinged end
